    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33281" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pābŭlātor</span></b> ,
			ōris, m.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A fodderer</i>, <i>a herdsman;</i>
			only according to the gloss: pabulator pastor, qui bubus pabula
			praebet, Isid. Gloss.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In milit. lang., <i>a forager</i>, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. C.
				1, 55</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. B. G. 5, 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hirt.
				B. G. 8, 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 27, 43</span></i>; <i><span class="en">29, 2</span></i>.</div>
